WEBVTT

00:03.330 --> 00:05.040
Sakuna Memoir...

00:05.040 --> 00:06.250
Y-yes?

00:06.250 --> 00:08.830
What's up with that fugly t-shirt?

00:09.290 --> 00:11.290
Are you making fun of me?

00:11.290 --> 00:13.580
I-I'm not doing anything of the sort!

00:13.580 --> 00:15.500
I really like this shirt!

00:15.500 --> 00:17.000
I'll even give it to you if-

00:17.000 --> 00:18.250
I don't want one!

00:18.250 --> 00:22.960
I can't think of the people that worship
Terakomari as anything but idiots.

00:25.920 --> 00:28.040
So, what do you want?

00:28.290 --> 00:30.380
U-um, well...

00:30.380 --> 00:32.830
Why are you here?

00:32.830 --> 00:34.920
I thought you'd be in prison...

00:34.920 --> 00:36.710
I was until very recently.

00:36.710 --> 00:39.170
I'm allowed to go out now.

00:39.420 --> 00:40.830
Allowed?

00:41.580 --> 00:43.000
Why?

00:46.080 --> 00:47.670
A lot happened.

00:50.830 --> 00:53.040
You want to leave Inverse Moon, huh?

00:54.460 --> 00:55.750
How do you...

00:55.750 --> 00:59.540
I can tell by the look on your face,
and that must be it

00:59.540 --> 01:01.380
if you've got business with me.

01:05.540 --> 01:07.330
Speaking of,

01:07.330 --> 01:10.710
your family was taken hostage
by Inverse Moon, right?

01:12.250 --> 01:14.960
You should talk to Komari
because of that, shouldn't you?

01:15.460 --> 01:19.500
I'm sure she'll put her audacious
sense of justice to work and help you.

01:21.710 --> 01:25.040
I can't get her involved in my situation.

01:26.670 --> 01:30.710
It looks like you don't have the courage
to exhaust every possible option.

01:34.880 --> 01:36.710
When things get tough...

01:37.630 --> 01:40.210
let Terakomari drink your blood.

01:45.830 --> 02:07.750
<b>The Vexations of a Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

03:14.040 --> 03:19.830
<b>The Scarlet Stage</b>

03:15.250 --> 03:16.250
Hey, right over here!

03:16.250 --> 03:17.330
Yeah, booze! Keep it comin'!

03:17.330 --> 03:19.830
And now, the moment
you've all been waiting for!

03:20.920 --> 03:23.790
The Crimson Lord's War will now commence!

03:26.170 --> 03:28.130
As a special rule this time,

03:28.130 --> 03:31.210
they will be competing for a
crimson sphere that is set on the field,

03:31.210 --> 03:32.750
in the center of the castle ruins!

03:33.130 --> 03:35.630
At sunset, which will be the time limit,

03:35.630 --> 03:38.750
the person in possession of
the crimson sphere will be the victor!

03:38.750 --> 03:43.170
Once again, the order of the winners
one through six will be determined by

03:43.170 --> 03:45.790
points gained by the end of combat!

03:45.790 --> 03:48.790
Killing one of the enemy soldiers
is one point!

03:48.790 --> 03:52.500
Killing a Crimson Lord
is an additional fifty points!

03:52.920 --> 03:57.170
The Crimson Lord with
the lowest score will resign!

03:57.540 --> 04:00.670
Each commander will have only 100 troops!

04:00.670 --> 04:04.210
The commanders' military acumen
and leadership will be tested!

04:05.040 --> 04:09.330
The winner will be given a reward
from Her Majesty!

04:10.250 --> 04:13.500
Now kill each other to your heart's content!

04:18.330 --> 04:21.210
Vill... I'd like to go home...

04:21.210 --> 04:25.000
If you do, you'll resign from the Crimson Lords
and explode by default.

04:29.170 --> 04:33.630
Kinda looks like I'm missing some troops.
There's only about 30 people.

04:34.080 --> 04:35.330
Did everyone oversleep?

04:35.330 --> 04:36.080
No.

04:36.080 --> 04:37.540
Then what's going on?

04:37.540 --> 04:43.540
They were killing each other to be chosen,
so among your 500 troops, 470 are dead.

04:43.540 --> 04:44.960
That's so stupid!

04:47.380 --> 04:48.630
Lady Komari.

04:48.630 --> 04:49.460
Hm?

04:51.670 --> 04:56.210
How are you doing today,
Terakomari Gandesblood?!

04:56.210 --> 04:57.040
Flöte!

04:57.250 --> 05:00.670
I do commend you just for not running away,

05:00.670 --> 05:05.330
but I'll make sure that today
I'll watch your pitiful self explode!

05:05.330 --> 05:08.540
What's this?
Are you so scared you're speechless?

05:08.540 --> 05:12.080
If you cry and plead for your life,
I'll go easy on you!

05:12.080 --> 05:15.380
At best, you can get your
subordinates to protect you.

05:15.380 --> 05:19.000
Well, the savages in the 7th Unit
would be instantly killed

05:19.000 --> 05:21.380
by the elite members of my 2nd Unit.

05:25.130 --> 05:29.040
Your Excellency, is it all right if I attack?

05:29.040 --> 05:32.170
Y-yeah, good luck out there.

05:33.830 --> 05:36.540
That little girl...

05:37.170 --> 05:39.040
Lady Flöte, we await your orders.

05:39.750 --> 05:42.170
All troops advance to the south!

05:42.790 --> 05:46.790
Lady Gandesblood is only
thinking about her own safety.

05:46.790 --> 05:48.380
Making her own troops guard her,

05:48.380 --> 05:51.080
of course she'll have her own troops
escort her back to her camp.

05:51.080 --> 05:52.580
Lady Mascarail!

05:52.580 --> 05:53.710
I have an urgent communication!

05:53.710 --> 05:57.790
All members of the 7th Unit are
advancing this way at breakneck speed!

06:03.210 --> 06:06.290
Kill Flöte Mascarail!

06:06.290 --> 06:07.080
Yeah!

06:07.080 --> 06:08.330
Bring it on!
C'mon, you dunderheads!<b></b>

06:11.250 --> 06:13.830
Isn't it weird as a commander
for the entire army to charge in

06:13.830 --> 06:15.540
and leave me behind?

06:16.790 --> 06:21.080
Oh, right, you're the only one
who stayed behind with me.

06:21.080 --> 06:23.630
I'm counting on you, Bucephalus.

06:24.580 --> 06:27.460
Prepare yourself, Bucephalus.

06:27.460 --> 06:31.670
If you let Lady Komari die,
you'll be made into stew for dinner.

06:31.670 --> 06:32.960
Stop that!

06:33.630 --> 06:34.710
Just joking.

06:34.710 --> 06:38.960
That aside, let's hurry up and
join with Sakuna's 6th unit!

06:39.500 --> 06:42.040
In order to do so, they must
break through Delphyne's troops

06:42.040 --> 06:44.130
who have taken up position
in the southeast.

06:44.130 --> 06:46.580
If they go in head on,
they'll kill you first.

06:51.380 --> 06:54.000
It's Captain Mellaconcey on reconnaissance.

06:54.250 --> 06:55.710
Helldeus' troops and Odilon's troops

06:55.710 --> 06:58.000
are clashing on the western side
of the castle ruins.

06:58.000 --> 07:00.250
If we go there now, they'll get
caught in the skirmish and die.

07:00.250 --> 07:03.080
Dangit! Then where do we go?!

07:08.630 --> 07:10.540
Those are Delphyne's troops.

07:10.540 --> 07:12.880
They're heading straight for us.

07:12.880 --> 07:14.630
Whaaaat?!

07:18.750 --> 07:22.080
This is definitely an attempt to kill you.

07:22.080 --> 07:24.500
In the depths of her mask
I feel a desire for revenge.

07:24.500 --> 07:27.330
Why? Was it something I did?

07:27.540 --> 07:29.960
Because, at the time of the
Crimson Lord's conference,

07:29.960 --> 07:32.670
it was determined that
you killed Lady Delphyne.

07:32.670 --> 07:33.880
That is a false accusation!

07:34.710 --> 07:37.880
We're leaving, Lady Komari.
If you stay here, you'll die.

07:38.380 --> 07:39.880
I wanna go home...

07:45.420 --> 07:48.250
L-Lady Komari... Don't touch me there!

07:48.250 --> 07:49.540
Shut your face!

07:49.540 --> 07:51.420
Let's get a move on, you pervy maid!

07:52.960 --> 07:56.750
General Terakomari's troops were all
ordered to head towards Flöte's troops,

07:56.750 --> 07:59.960
while she is drawing Delphyne's troops
to herself on her mount!

08:00.750 --> 08:04.880
Well, in the midst of this free-for-all,
the 6th Unit has yet to move.

08:04.880 --> 08:08.960
Apparently, there is no sign
of Commander Sakuna.

08:10.540 --> 08:13.420
Um, what should I do?

08:13.420 --> 08:17.170
How should I know?!
Come up with something yourself!

08:17.170 --> 08:18.500
You're so useless!

08:18.500 --> 08:20.080
The nerve of that man!

08:20.080 --> 08:22.250
You ass! Is that where-

08:24.170 --> 08:27.130
Excuse me, what was that communication?

08:27.130 --> 08:31.500
Isn't Terakomari Gandesblood
working together with us?

08:33.040 --> 08:37.040
Yes, she is, but that sort of thing
doesn't matter, does it?

08:38.750 --> 08:41.580
We must be of help to her.

08:42.040 --> 08:43.880
For that to happen...

08:48.130 --> 08:50.960
Our target is Flöte Mascarail.

08:51.670 --> 08:54.210
Capture her and present her to me.

08:55.670 --> 08:56.880
Yes, ma'am.

08:58.250 --> 08:59.670
Did you see that, Armand?

08:59.670 --> 09:02.290
That is, without a doubt, a Core Implosion.

09:02.290 --> 09:03.960
It's clearly very obvious!

09:03.960 --> 09:06.500
There is also no doubt that
Sakuna Memoir is guilty

09:06.500 --> 09:08.790
of the serial killings of
high-level government officials.

09:08.790 --> 09:09.960
We must apprehend her immediately!

09:09.960 --> 09:11.000
Well, hold on.

09:11.380 --> 09:13.580
Even if you do intervene at this current time,
you'll be doing nothing but

09:13.580 --> 09:15.790
grabbing onto a lizard's tail that's
already separated from its body.

09:15.790 --> 09:19.880
Do you think there's someone
manipulating Sakuna Memoir?

09:19.880 --> 09:21.580
Precisely.

09:21.580 --> 09:24.960
And also, that person is
a member of Inverse Moon,

09:24.960 --> 09:27.880
and they're currently on the battleground.

09:30.250 --> 09:32.790
I've had enough! Let's leave, Vill!

09:35.380 --> 09:37.920
It's all right. Let's keep heading west.

09:37.920 --> 09:39.880
Don't wanna, don't wanna, don't wanna!

09:39.880 --> 09:41.670
Let's get outta here!
Outside of the battlegrounds!

09:41.670 --> 09:42.880
Do you want to explode?

09:42.880 --> 09:44.540
I don't wanna explode!

09:51.210 --> 09:52.960
What the heck is that?

09:53.170 --> 09:54.580
I'm not letting you get away.

10:08.630 --> 10:10.000
This is bad.

10:10.000 --> 10:10.960
Huh?

10:13.250 --> 10:17.380
Gandesblood.
Are you the one who killed me?

10:17.380 --> 10:21.540
No! You were, uh... not killed,

10:22.210 --> 10:24.670
but maybe just died of
food poisoning or something?

10:24.670 --> 10:25.920
Don't lie.

10:25.920 --> 10:27.290
It's not a lie!

10:27.290 --> 10:29.790
Maybe you ate a sprouted potato or something?

10:30.830 --> 10:33.920
You... are full of lies.

10:34.290 --> 10:39.170
Your words, your track record,
your capabilities, all of them are lies.

10:39.170 --> 10:41.290
Lies, lies, lies!

10:44.420 --> 10:46.710
What?! What are you doing?!

10:50.960 --> 10:51.960
Her blood...

10:55.130 --> 10:56.330
Lady Komari!

11:00.380 --> 11:01.460
Lady Komari!

11:03.290 --> 11:05.250
You masked degenerate...

11:05.250 --> 11:07.750
How dare you mark Lady Komari's soft skin!

11:14.460 --> 11:15.540
Vill?!

11:16.380 --> 11:17.750
No...

11:18.710 --> 11:21.460
Lady Komari, please run...

11:21.460 --> 11:23.630
You really think I could leave you behind?!

11:23.630 --> 11:26.080
How could you injure Vill?!

11:26.080 --> 11:28.040
Only using projectile weapons is unfair!

11:28.040 --> 11:30.920
And what the heck is up with that mask?!
Are you a degenerate or something?!

11:30.920 --> 11:33.880
Using blood to attack is what cowards do!

11:34.210 --> 11:36.500
Provocation won't work on me!

11:38.080 --> 11:41.630
But being called a coward is outrageous.

11:42.330 --> 11:46.540
Brace yourself, you cocky little gremlin.

11:59.040 --> 12:00.460
Bucephalus!

12:02.130 --> 12:03.500
Oh no you don't!

12:05.710 --> 12:07.580
We're gonna run into a wall!

12:07.580 --> 12:10.000
Grab on tight, Lady Komari!

12:14.210 --> 12:15.830
I-is he okay?

12:16.040 --> 12:18.040
He must have pushed himself pretty hard...

12:18.040 --> 12:19.210
He's fine.

12:19.210 --> 12:22.710
The red dragon's scales can repel
even iron swords.

12:28.920 --> 12:32.540
Nicely done, Bucephalus!
It's a straight shot to the old castle!

12:32.580 --> 12:35.960
Darn it. And he was so close
to being a stew.

12:35.960 --> 12:37.580
No way! You can't do that!

12:38.830 --> 12:40.830
That person is not human!

12:42.460 --> 12:44.580
You're in her sights, Lady Komari.

12:46.880 --> 12:50.460
Oh, if it isn't Lady Gandesblood!

12:50.460 --> 12:51.710
Yeah!

12:51.710 --> 12:53.290
Did you say "Gandesblood"?

12:53.290 --> 12:54.500
Capture her!

12:55.750 --> 12:59.540
Commander Terakomari is taking Delphyne troops
charging into the west side of the old castle

12:59.540 --> 13:04.380
where Helldeus troops and Odilon troops
are engaged in battle!

13:04.670 --> 13:07.580
What a bold strategy!

13:10.000 --> 13:14.290
Oh crap, this is the end,
I'm definitely gonna die now!

13:14.500 --> 13:17.210
You cannot lose heart now, Lady Komari!

13:17.210 --> 13:19.380
Leave everything to me!

13:29.330 --> 13:30.670
Why?!

13:32.960 --> 13:36.290
Hey, this is poison, isn't it?!
We're gonna die too, aren't we?

13:36.290 --> 13:39.290
Not to worry, this is poison gas
that only kills men.

13:39.290 --> 13:40.790
Is that really a thing?!

13:40.790 --> 13:42.920
Let's hurry and destroy that crimson sphere.

13:43.290 --> 13:45.880
If we do that, the outcome will still be vague!

13:45.880 --> 13:49.630
Die, die, die, die, you lying
little gremlin of a girl!

13:49.630 --> 13:54.540
Commander Komari,
fending off a furious pursuit,

13:54.540 --> 13:56.380
reaches the castle ruins!

13:57.830 --> 13:59.500
Not on my watch!

14:09.040 --> 14:12.380
Vill! You can rest now; I'll go by myself!

14:17.540 --> 14:19.670
You're not getting away from me.

14:19.670 --> 14:22.000
Crap, what do I do now...

14:22.500 --> 14:24.080
I'm all right.

14:24.080 --> 14:25.920
Please run, Lady Komari.

14:25.920 --> 14:26.880
You dummy!

14:26.880 --> 14:30.170
I don't need your self-sacrificial crap
right now! You and I are gonna-

14:30.170 --> 14:32.080
You won't with me around.

14:53.170 --> 14:55.580
You lot sure are persistent.

15:22.380 --> 15:23.790
No matter.

15:23.790 --> 15:27.210
I'll banish all of you to beyond the darkness.

15:38.040 --> 15:39.670
That magic...

15:39.670 --> 15:41.250
Your Excellency...!

15:42.170 --> 15:45.130
Komarin! Komarin! Komarin!

15:59.710 --> 16:00.960
What just happened?

16:00.960 --> 16:02.040
Wow...

16:03.830 --> 16:05.000
Wasn't expecting that!

16:06.750 --> 16:10.630
Did you see that?
It's the Effulgent light spell, "Dawn of Hell"!

16:10.630 --> 16:13.380
Never thought I'd live to see the day!

16:13.380 --> 16:15.290
This is nothing to laugh at.

16:15.290 --> 16:17.290
Komari has used her Core Implosion again...

16:17.290 --> 16:20.290
What, that's nothing to worry about.

16:29.040 --> 16:30.210
Huh?

16:31.460 --> 16:35.880
I know that... I was attacked by
Delphyne, and I ran away...

16:37.330 --> 16:39.830
And what happened after that?

16:43.170 --> 16:44.960
Oh, right! Vill!

16:45.790 --> 16:47.250
Where are you?

16:48.960 --> 16:50.250
Vill!

16:52.880 --> 16:55.630
Thank goodness, she's still alive.

16:57.170 --> 16:58.750
Thank you.

16:58.750 --> 17:01.500
I'm transferring you to a hospital so rest.

17:09.080 --> 17:10.460
What is this...

17:10.920 --> 17:12.330
a dream?

17:14.710 --> 17:16.710
Could this be...?

17:16.710 --> 17:18.710
Miss Gandesblood.

17:22.460 --> 17:24.210
Fancy meeting you here.

17:24.960 --> 17:26.500
Flöte.

17:27.380 --> 17:29.750
Where's everyone else?

17:29.750 --> 17:31.250
Are you alone?

17:32.420 --> 17:33.920
Alone?

17:35.210 --> 17:36.960
Yes, I am!

17:36.960 --> 17:40.080
You slaughtered every single
one of them out there!

17:40.080 --> 17:41.170
Huh?

17:41.170 --> 17:44.880
Lord Heaven, and Lord Metal,
and Miss Memoir, and Delphyne too!

17:44.880 --> 17:46.380
Wh-what are you talking about?!

17:46.380 --> 17:47.880
This isn't making sense!

17:47.880 --> 17:50.500
You had a large-scale bomb
or something, right?

17:50.500 --> 17:54.790
It's impossible that you can use magic
with such destructive force as that!

17:54.790 --> 17:56.460
No, I mean...

18:01.040 --> 18:03.000
Is that the crimson sphere?

18:03.000 --> 18:04.330
Don't tell me you...

18:04.830 --> 18:07.540
No! I didn't destroy it...

18:07.540 --> 18:09.290
You're lying to me!

18:09.290 --> 18:12.670
You destroy the crimson sphere and
spoil our Crimson Lord's War

18:12.670 --> 18:15.040
simply because you want to save yourself...

18:15.040 --> 18:16.460
I'm telling you, I didn't!

18:16.460 --> 18:19.250
When I came too, it was already crushed!

18:20.250 --> 18:22.710
You are a cancer on the empire.

18:23.080 --> 18:27.040
I won't let you do as you please any longer.

18:31.250 --> 18:33.250
I don't want to be killed!

18:33.250 --> 18:35.420
Then confront me like a true warrior!

18:39.000 --> 18:42.460
Dark Spell: "Darkness Armage-"

18:50.630 --> 18:51.670
Huh?

19:16.880 --> 19:21.170
I'm so happy I can finally see you...

19:22.790 --> 19:26.790
Y-yeah, I'm glad you're okay too.

19:27.500 --> 19:33.580
But... Sakuna, have you always
been this strong?

19:33.830 --> 19:35.670
I'm not strong.

19:35.670 --> 19:38.040
Miss Flöte let her guard down.

19:38.630 --> 19:42.130
But you're a magic user, aren't you, Sakuna?

19:42.130 --> 19:45.040
Piercing through a body
with your bare hands...

19:45.040 --> 19:46.960
You did that too, right?

19:46.960 --> 19:50.960
Anyone can do that.
As long as you're a normal vampire...

19:50.960 --> 19:52.130
I-I see.

19:52.130 --> 19:57.290
Yes. Now most of the
Seven Crimson Lords are dead.

20:12.960 --> 20:14.580
Do you remember?

20:14.920 --> 20:15.920
What?

20:16.250 --> 20:21.540
The question I asked you,
that night we were stargazing together.

20:26.210 --> 20:28.580
What you told me then...

20:28.580 --> 20:32.500
You said you'd kill the terrorist
threatening me.

20:33.750 --> 20:35.960
I thought that you were the greatest.

20:36.790 --> 20:38.210
Sakuna?

20:38.830 --> 20:41.170
Looking at the circumstances,

20:41.170 --> 20:44.580
I didn't think you were bluffing
or just showing off;

20:44.580 --> 20:48.080
I knew you were seriously telling the truth.

20:48.580 --> 20:51.040
What are you talking about?

20:51.500 --> 20:54.380
But I can't be like that.

20:54.380 --> 20:58.330
Inverse Moon will never grant my wish,
not with my strength as it is now.

20:58.750 --> 21:00.540
No matter how hard I work,

21:00.540 --> 21:02.580
how obedient I am to the organization,

21:02.580 --> 21:05.290
how much I'm begged to just quit,

21:05.290 --> 21:08.830
they're going to kill the people
most important to me.

21:09.210 --> 21:12.080
There's nothing I can do about it.

21:12.080 --> 21:14.710
Because I don't have
the strength or the courage,

21:14.710 --> 21:16.790
and I don't want to be killed.

21:18.000 --> 21:20.750
I have only one choice.

21:21.420 --> 21:23.500
Up until now, and here forward...

21:23.960 --> 21:27.580
I can only work as desperately as possible,
as a cog in Inverse Moon.

21:30.460 --> 21:34.670
Miss Flöte doesn't know where
the Dark Core is, either.

21:39.960 --> 21:42.540
Miss Terakomari, forgive me.

21:42.880 --> 21:45.040
The terrorist is actually...

21:45.460 --> 21:47.170
me.

21:48.420 --> 21:51.250
Sakuna, are you crying?

21:51.250 --> 21:52.960
Are you hurt?

21:52.960 --> 21:56.170
Why are you worrying about me?

21:56.170 --> 21:59.330
I'm an Inverse Moon terrorist.

21:59.330 --> 22:00.630
Stop joking around!

22:00.630 --> 22:03.000
If it's so bad you want to cry,
then let's leave together...

22:05.040 --> 22:07.500
I can't go home, even if I wanted to.

22:08.880 --> 22:12.130
I wanted you to know what's going on.

22:12.920 --> 22:17.540
It's unfortunate to kill each other
while you know nothing.

22:19.040 --> 22:22.710
Mental Spell: "Mind Refrain."

23:58.580 --> 24:01.000
<b>Wheels of Asterism</b>

23:58.750 --> 24:00.580
"Wheels of Asterism."
